<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani money market closed on holiday.</title>
<headline>Pakistani money market closed on holiday.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pakistani money market remained closed on Wednesday's national public holiday to celebrate the birthday of Pakistan's founder Mohammad Ali Jinnah.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Thursday.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, the overnight inter-bank call rate in the money market closed at 8.00 percent.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
